      "content": "REST API for the Segments.ai data-labeling platform for computer vision. Manage datasets, samples, labels, labelsets, and versioned releases for 2D image segmentation/vectors and 3D point cloud and multi-sensor fusion annotation. Authenticate by sending an API key in the Authorization header as `Authorization: APIKey YOUR_API_KEY`.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Segments.ai Support",
